{{- /*
  The `twin` format's producer, wired only by the `unpublished` environment.

  It renders NOTHING for a page carrying `twin: false`, which is how a wired
  format and a published document come apart: Hugo writes no file for a
  zero-byte render, reports that nowhere, and keeps reporting the format on the
  page with a resolving .RelPermalink. Its answer to the manifest lives beside
  it in _partials/url-retirement/publishes/twin.html.
*/ -}}
{{- if ne .Params.twin false -}}
TWIN {{ .Title }}
{{ end -}}
